{"id":"995dd9138f5c3e5a","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-omega-provability.md","title":"Omega Provability and Its Predicate","display":"df-omega-provability — Omega Provability and Its Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-omega-provability","aliases":["89-df-omega-provability"],"display":"df-omega-provability — Omega Provability and Its Predicate","depends_on":["[[89-df-omega-consistency]]","[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-omega-provability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-omega-provability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-provability — Omega Provability and Its Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f367207d33b1e75f\" href=\"?note=f367207d33b1e75f\" title=\"89-df-omega-consistency\">89-df-omega-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg S\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg S\\)</span> 表示新增闭句公理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{OneVar}(b)\">\\(\\mathsf{OneVar}(b)\\)</span> 判定公式码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 的自由变元至多为指定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{all}(b)\">\\(\\mathsf{all}(b)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{imp}(a,c)\">\\(\\mathsf{imp}(a,c)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{sub}(b,n)\">\\(\\mathsf{sub}(b,n)\\)</span> 是固定原始递归编码操作，最后一项代入数词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在对象语言中，上述编码函数作为其 PA 可证明总的图公式的定义性缩写使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WCon}\">\\(\\mathrm{WCon}\\)</span> 是上条元层谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\)</span> 为对象可证性公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WProv}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{WProv}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}(b,x)\">\\(\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}(b,x)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(x)\">\\(\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(x)\\)</span> 分别是下述定义的元层谓词及两个对象公式。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}provability}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WProv}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{WCon}(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg S),\\\\\n\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}(b,x)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{OneVar}(b)\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\mathsf{imp}(\\mathsf{all}(b),x))\n\\land\\forall n\\,\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\mathsf{sub}(b,n)),\\\\\n\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists b\\,\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}(b,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{WProv}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathbb N\\models\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(\\overline{\\ulcorner S\\urcorner}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}provability}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WProv}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{WCon}(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg S),\\\\\n\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}(b,x)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{OneVar}(b)\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\mathsf{imp}(\\mathsf{all}(b),x))\n\\land\\forall n\\,\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\mathsf{sub}(b,n)),\\\\\n\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists b\\,\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}(b,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{WProv}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathbb N\\models\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(\\overline{\\ulcorner S\\urcorner}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 15 章，印刷页 188–191；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n等价性是原书 Theorem 1：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg S\">\\(\\neg S\\)</span> 使理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 不一致，等价于存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(x)\">\\(B(x)\\)</span>，PA 逐个证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(\\bar n)\">\\(B(\\bar n)\\)</span> 且证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xB\\to S\">\\(\\forall xB\\to S\\)</span>；即一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则足够。将有限多个此类应用合并成一个合取公式，仍可归并到一次；这不同于允许任意深度的完整闭包。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}\">\\(\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}\\)</span> 可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_2\">\\(\\Pi_2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}\">\\(\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}\\)</span> 可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_3\">\\(\\Sigma_3\\)</span>。因此把它当作完整 PA <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则可证性（恰为标准算术真）会错误地产生一个算术真谓词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"f367207d33b1e75f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{OneVar}(b)","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{all}(b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{imp}(a,c)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{sub}(b,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WCon}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WProv}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}(b,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}provability}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WProv}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(S)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{WCon}(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg S),\\\\\n\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}(b,x)&\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{OneVar}(b)\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\mathsf{imp}(\\mathsf{all}(b),x))\n\\land\\forall n\\,\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\mathsf{sub}(b,n)),\\\\\n\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(x)&\\coloneqq\\exists b\\,\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}(b,x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{WProv}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(S)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathbb N\\models\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}(\\overline{\\ulcorner S\\urcorner}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg S","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"B(x)","display":false},{"tex":"B(\\bar n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall xB\\to S","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\mathrm{Pf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\mathrm{Bew}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2363,"backlinks":[{"id":"0fcc108fa2ae7636","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-provability]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-consistency]] → [[89-df-omega-provability]] → [[89-df-bimodal-formula]] → [[89-df-glb-logic]] → [[89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization]] → [[89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness]] → [[89-thm-glb-kripke-incomplete]] → [[89-df-glsb-logic]] → [[89-thm-glsb-truth-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["f367207d33b1e75f","841985de31202f85","a257e5b1de6880b7"]}